## 2. Ingestion and Synthesis Pipeline

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Developer as Developer / Participant
    participant Ingestion as Ingestion Engine
    participant SQLite as SQLite Database (aether.db)
    participant Sensor as Tavily Sensor
    participant LLM as Gemini 2.5 Flash
    participant Graph as Neo4j Aura Cloud
    participant Client as Web / CLI / Integrations

    Developer->>Ingestion: Emit Event (CSV Row / GitHub Push Webhook)
    Ingestion->>SQLite: Persist Raw Record (Normalized Schema)
    Ingestion->>Sensor: Fetch Live Grounding Context
    Sensor-->>Ingestion: External Repository / Activity Signals
    Ingestion->>LLM: Perform Semantic Context Synthesis
    LLM-->>Ingestion: Executive Narrative and Complementary Profiling
    Ingestion->>SQLite: Store Synthesized Context and Audit Log
    Ingestion->>Graph: Upsert Nodes (User, Archetype, Skill, Project) and Edges
    Graph-->>Client: Stream Live Graph Delta via WebSocket (/ws/graph)
```

