## 4. Sponsor Technology Utilization

| Technology | Sponsor Role | Architectural Function within AETHER |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **Neo4j Aura Cloud** | Graph Database Sponsor | Live cloud instance (`neo4j+s://b6c72f14.databases.neo4j.io`). Persists relational topology of `User`, `Archetype`, `Skill`, and `Project` nodes. Powers the interactive 60fps graph canvas, bidirectional `COMPLEMENTS` traversals, and live Cypher execution (`POST /api/graph/cypher`). |
| **Tavily AI** | Search and Sensor Sponsor | Live Web Sensor API (`tvly-dev-...`). On every conversational inquiry or candidate verification, Tavily executes dynamic external web grounding against real-world GitHub repositories, preventing hallucination. |
| **Google Gemini 2.5 Flash** | Cognitive Reasoning Sponsor | High-velocity cognitive intelligence model (`models/gemini-2.5-flash`). Translates quantitative telemetry, commit metrics, and archetype tags into executive talent summaries and pairing analyses. |
| **SQLite (WAL Mode)** | Persistent Embedded Storage | High-concurrency zero-latency ACID database (`backend/database/aether.db`). Persists 661 verified hackathon participant profiles, normalized external tables, opportunity mappings, and real-time audit trails with measured millisecond latencies. |

---

## 5. Technology Stack

### Backend
- **Language**: Python 3.13
- **Web Framework**: FastAPI (Asynchronous ASGI)
- **Database**: SQLite (WAL mode, Foreign Keys enabled)
- **Graph Database**: Neo4j Aura Cloud (Bolt protocol over TLS)
- **External Sensors**: Tavily AI Search API
- **Reasoning Models**: Google Gemini 2.5 Flash
- **WebSockets**: Native ASGI WebSockets for real-time telemetry broadcast

### Frontend
- **Command Center**: Vanilla JavaScript (ES6+), TailwindCSS, HTML5 Canvas Graph Visualizer
- **Landing Page**: Tailored typography (Plus Jakarta Sans, JetBrains Mono), Responsive 1px border architecture, Zero-overflow CSS layout
- **Styling Architecture**: Obsidian palette (`#09090b`, `#121216`, `#18181f`), Refero-grade aesthetic polish

### Terminal Interface (CLI / TUI)
- **Engine**: Python `rich` library
- **Surfaces**: Command mode (`check`, `ask`, `match`, `users`, `cypher`, `audit`) and Interactive REPL Shell mode (`python cli/aether.py tui`)

---

## 6. End-to-End API Specification

### 6.1 Existence Verification
Verify whether a given participant exists in the registry.

```http
GET /api/users/check?q=Shiv
```

**Response (`200 OK`)**:
```json
{
  "exists": true,
  "query": "Shiv",
  "user": {
    "user_id": "usr_001",
    "username": "shiv_dev",
    "name": "Shiv Sharma",
    "email": "shiv@nexus.dev",
    "archetype": "High-Velocity Systems Architect",
    "reliability_score": 96.4,
    "commit_velocity": 94,
    "win_rate": 33.3,
    "primary_domain": "Low-Level Systems, Distributed Consensus & Graph Engines"
  },
  "message": "Verified: Shiv Sharma (@shiv_dev) is active in the user base."
}
```

### 6.2 Conversational Cognitive Query
Perform semantic context synthesis with live Tavily web grounding and Gemini 2.5 Flash narrative reasoning.

```http
POST /api/agent/query
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "Is Shiv in our database? What has he built?"
}
```

### 6.3 Autonomous Squad Matchmaking
Form an orthogonal squad balancing systems, frontend, and AI skillsets.

```http
POST /api/matchmaking/squad
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "target_goal": "AI Systems & Web3",
  "squad_size": 3
}
```

**Response (`200 OK`)**:
```json
{
  "target_goal": "AI Systems & Web3",
  "squad_size": 3,
  "synergy_score": 99.6,
  "squad_members": [
    {
      "user_id": "part_001",
      "name": "Shashank Tomar",
      "assigned_role": "Lead Architect & Systems Core",
      "archetype": "High-Velocity Systems Architect",
      "reliability_score": 98.8
    },
    {
      "user_id": "part_002",
      "name": "Ankit Gupta",
      "assigned_role": "Frontend & Interaction Craftsperson",
      "archetype": "Elite Frontend & Motion Craftsperson",
      "reliability_score": 98.8
    },
    {
      "user_id": "part_003",
      "name": "Mani Pal",
      "assigned_role": "Product Strategist & GTM Lead",
      "archetype": "Product Strategist & Market Architect",
      "reliability_score": 98.8
    }
  ],
  "architectural_rationale": "Assembled a high-alignment 3-person squad achieving a 99.6% mathematical synergy rating."
}
```

### 6.4 Live Cypher Console
Execute queries directly against connected Neo4j Aura Cloud graph.

```http
POST /api/graph/cypher
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "MATCH (u:User)-[:HAS_ARCHETYPE]->(a:Archetype) RETURN u.name, a.name LIMIT 5"
}
```

### 6.5 External Bot Webhook Endpoints
- `POST /api/integrations/telegram/webhook`: Formats and delivers Telegram markdown profile cards.
- `GET /api/integrations/telegram/simulate?q=shiv_dev`: Telegram command testing simulator.
- `POST /api/integrations/slack/webhook`: Returns official Slack Block Kit JSON payloads.
- `GET /api/integrations/slack/simulate?q=shiv_dev`: Slack command testing simulator.
- `POST /webhooks/github`: Receives live commit and PR webhooks, indexing activity and broadcasting via WebSocket.

