## 8. CLI Usage Guide

AETHER provides a complete terminal interface matching the capabilities of the Web Command Center:

```bash
# Verify participant existence (exact token or substring matching)
python cli/aether.py check Shiv

# Query any of the 656 real dataset participants
python cli/aether.py check scriptedbyshivam

# Natural language conversational context query
python cli/aether.py ask "Who is our best frontend engineer with high design taste?"

# Squad assembly with synergy score output
python cli/aether.py match --goal "AI Systems & Web3" --size 3

# Display paginated table of indexed platform users
python cli/aether.py users

# Execute live Cypher query against Neo4j Aura Cloud
python cli/aether.py cypher "MATCH (u:User) RETURN u.name, u.archetype LIMIT 5"

# Inspect persistent SQLite audit logs
python cli/aether.py audit

# Launch interactive Claude-grade TUI REPL
python cli/aether.py tui
```

